8. Production concept — Docker volume

Currently your website exists inside the container image.

If the container is deleted:

docker rm -f company-web

the container's writable filesystem disappears.

For persistent data, use a volume.

Create:

docker volume create company-web-data

Check:

docker volume ls

Inspect:

docker volume inspect company-web-data
9. Use a volume with Nginx

Create a test container:

docker run -d \
  --name company-web-volume \
  -p 8081:80 \
  -v company-web-data:/usr/share/nginx/html \
  nginx:alpine

Check:

docker ps

Now we have:

8080 → company-web
8081 → company-web-volume

Test:

curl http://localhost:8081
